#: simulation/data/civs/athen.json
msgid "Silver Owls"
msgstr "Hopeapöllöt"

#: simulation/data/civs/athen.json
msgid ""
"The mines at Laureion in Attica provided Athens with a wealth of silver from"
" which to mint her famous and highly prized coin, The Athenian Owl."
msgstr "Laureionin kaivokset Atticassa tuottivat ateenalaisille runsaasti hopeaa, josta he löivät kuuluisaa ja kallisarvoista rahaansa, Ateenan pöllöä."

