#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trademasters"
msgstr "Kauppamestarit"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginians were broadly known for their extensive trade over the "
"Mediterranean Sea."
msgstr "Karthagolaiset tunnettiin laajalti mittavasta kaupankäynnistään Välimerellä."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trade ships are available in the Village Phase."
msgstr "Kauppalaivat ovat saatavilla kylävaiheessa."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Mining Economy"
msgstr "Kaivostalous"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginian economy was centered around mining, with stone comprising "
"much of Carthage's structures."
msgstr "Karthagon talous keskittyi kaivostoimintaan, ja Karthagon rakennukset olivat pääosin kiveä."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Stone mining technologies are free and instant."
msgstr "Kivilouhinnan teknologiat ovat ilmaisia ja välittömiä."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Numidian Cavalry"
msgstr "Numidian ratsuväki"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Numidian cavalry's horses, ancestors of the Berber horse, were small "
"compared with other horses of the era, and were well adapted for faster "
"movement over long distances."
msgstr "Numidian ratsuväen hevoset, berberihevosen esi-isät, olivat pieniä muihin aikakauden hevosiin verrattuna ja ne sopivat hyvin nopeaan, pitkänmatkan liikkumiseen."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Cavalry Javelineers +10% walk speed."
msgstr "Ratsuväen keihäänheittäjille +10 % kävelynopeutta."

